<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Navlog {{ origin }} → {{ destination }}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 8mm 7mm 11mm 7mm;
    @bottom-left  { content: "{{ page_footer }}"; font: 6pt Arial, sans-serif; color: #555; }
    @bottom-right { content: "page " counter(page) " / " counter(pages); font: 6pt Arial, sans-serif; color: #555; }
  }
  html { font-size: 9pt; }
  body { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #000; background: #fff; margin: 0; line-height: 1.2; }
  @media screen { html { background: #ececec; } body { max-width: 850px; margin: 18px auto; padding: 16px 18px; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.15); } }

  h1 { font-size: 11.5pt; margin: 0 0 1.5mm; color: #12232e; letter-spacing: .3px; }
  .facts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .8mm 4mm; margin: 0 0 2mm; font-size: 7pt; }
  .fact b { display: block; font-size: 5.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3px; color: #555; font-weight: 600; }
  .mono { font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 6.8pt; table-layout: fixed; }
  th, td { border: .5pt solid #888; padding: 1mm 1mm; vertical-align: top; }
  th { background: #12232e; color: #fff; font-size: 5.8pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .2px; text-align: center; padding: 1mm 0.5mm; }
  td { height: 15mm; }               /* hauteur d'écriture pour les cases à remplir */
  .c { text-align: center; }
  .big { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; }
  .sub { font-size: 6pt; color: #444; }
  .lbl { font-size: 5.5pt; color: #888; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3px; }
  .blank { display: block; border-bottom: .5pt solid #bbb; height: 3.2mm; }
  /* Colonnes à remplir en vol : en-tête bleu clair, fond blanc. */
  th.fill { background: #35618e; }
  .eto b { font-size: 8.5pt; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #fbfbfb; }
  .totals td { height: auto; font-weight: 700; background: #f0f0f0; border-top: 1.4pt solid #000; }

  .disclaimer { margin-top: 2.5mm; padding-top: 1.5mm; border-top: 1pt solid #000; font-size: 6.5pt; color: #333; }
  .disclaimer b { color: #b3261e; }
</style>

<h1>LOG DE NAVIGATION — {{ origin }} → {{ destination }}</h1>
<div class="facts">
  <div class="fact"><b>Aéronef</b><span class="mono">{{ aircraft_name }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Départ prévu</b><span class="mono">{{ departure_dual }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Arrivée est.</b><span class="mono">{{ arrival_dual }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>TAS</b><span class="mono">{{ tas_kt }} kt</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Conso</b><span class="mono">{{ fuel_flow_lph }} L/h</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Décl.</b><span class="mono">{{ mag_var_label }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Total</b><span class="mono">{{ total_distance }} NM · {{ total_time }} · {{ total_fuel }}</span></div>
</div>

<table>
  <colgroup>
    <col style="width:15%"><col style="width:11%"><col style="width:13%"><col style="width:14%">
    <col style="width:15%"><col style="width:20%"><col style="width:12%">
  </colgroup>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th class="left">Branche</th>
      <th>Alt / Zmin</th>
      <th>RM<br><span style="font-weight:400">(Rv · Dv)</span></th>
      <th>Dist / Temps</th>
      <th class="fill">Report · Heures</th>
      <th class="fill">Observations<br><span style="font-weight:400">vent · radiales · radios</span></th>
      <th class="fill">Déroutement<br>urgence</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for r in rows %}
    <tr>
      <td class="mono">{{ r.branch }}</td>
      <td class="c">
        <span class="big">{{ r.altitude }}</span><span class="sub"> ft</span>
        <span class="lbl">Zmin</span><span class="blank"></span>
      </td>
      <td class="c">
        <span class="big">{{ r.magnetic_heading }}°</span>
        <div class="sub">Rv {{ r.true_track }} · Dv {{ r.drift }}</div>
        <div class="sub">{{ r.wind }} · Vs {{ r.ground_speed }}</div>
      </td>
      <td class="c">
        <div><b>DI</b> {{ r.distance }} <span class="sub">NM</span></div>
        <div class="sub">DTG {{ r.dtg }} · cumul {{ r.cumulative }}</div>
        <div class="sub">Tsv {{ r.tsv }}′ · Tav {{ r.tav }}′</div>
      </td>
      <td>
        <span class="lbl">Report</span><span class="blank"></span>
        <div class="eto"><span class="lbl">Est.</span> <b>{{ r.eto_local }}</b> <span class="sub">{{ r.eto_zulu }}</span></div>
        <span class="lbl">Réelle</span><span class="blank"></span>
      </td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    <tr class="totals">
      <td>TOTAL</td>
      <td class="c">—</td>
      <td class="c">—</td>
      <td class="c">{{ total_distance }} NM · {{ total_time }}</td>
      <td><span class="lbl">Arrivée est.</span> <b>{{ arrival_local }}</b></td>
      <td class="c">Conso totale {{ total_fuel }}</td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p class="disclaimer">
  <b>AIDE À LA PRÉPARATION — ne remplace pas le calcul officiel ni le jugement du commandant de bord.</b>
  Colonnes bleutées <b>à remplir en vol</b> (Zmin, point de report, heure réelle, observations, déroutement).
  <b>RM = Rv − déclinaison</b> ({{ mag_var_label }}, à confirmer sur la carte). DI = distance de branche, DTG = distance restante,
  Tsv/Tav = temps sans / avec vent. Vent en altitude interpolé — source <b>Open-Meteo</b> (GFS/ARPEGE), à l'heure de départ.
  <b>TAS et conso PROVISOIRES</b> (valeurs typiques DR400/160, pas encore le manuel F-ZZZZ).
  Heures locales = {{ display_timezone }}, Z indiqué. Généré le {{ generated_dual }}.
</p>
